sequenceDiagram
    box Aqua Group
    participant Alice
    participant John
    end
    autonumber 10 5
    loop Every minute
        John-->>Alice: Great!
    end
    opt Extra response
        Alice->>John: Thanks
    end
    par Alice to Bob
        Alice->>Bob: Hello guys!
    and Alice to John
        Alice->>John: Hello guys!
    end
    critical Establish a connection
        Alice-->Bob: connect
    option Network timeout
        Alice-->Alice: Log error
    end
    break when the booking process fails
        Alice-->Bob: show failure
    end
    rect rgb(191, 223, 255)
        Alice->>John: in a box
    end
    Note left of Alice: left
    Note right of John: right
    link Alice: Dashboard @ https://dashboard.contoso.com/alice
